  "name": "Molten Core: Magmadar's body cycles Ancient Hysteria, Dread, Fury and Despair every 66.6-70.2s",
  "contract": [
    "Archive WoWCombatLog evidence (4 Magmadar pulls with the cycle, 2026-05-28 to 2026-08-23): one area spell on the raid, always in the order Hysteria 2105311,",
    "Dread 2105312, Fury 2105313, Despair 2105310, first cast 31.9-35.9s after the pull, then 66.6-70.2s between casts; the starting spell differs per pull, so the server",
    "draws it at random. No spell lands before 25s; once four casts have run (at most 246.5s) each of the four was cast exactly once."
